(Regression test: Execute with a list VARIABLE as arguments, not a
 literal. argv is built at runtime by _list_to_argv from the list's
 length. Previously only literal lists were accepted.)

a list called "echoargs" is ["from", "a", "list", "variable"].
Print "before exec".
Execute "/bin/echo" with arguments echoargs.
